{"synopsis":"Saya Hwapyung.\n\nSeorang pria yang ingin hidup normal seperti namanya.\n\nSemua yang dia miliki dalam kehidupan duniawinya hancur.\n\n[Cintamu telah menjadi kebencianku.]\n\nSeharusnya kau tidak main-main denganku sejak awal.\n\nAnda seharusnya membiarkan saya menjalani kehidupan yang tenang.\n\nDan sekarang dia telah memulai langkahnya agar tidak ada musuh bebuyutannya yang akan selamat dari amarahnya.","alternative_title":"The Invincible Man","author":"Cyungchan Noh","artist":"], Hwi [Add","chapters":[{"number":"103","chapter":"103","slug":"ddfb00d4-5879-49d7-be3d-8d2b5f028aa0","date":"2025-12-12","images":[]},{"number":"102","chapter":"102","slug":"42f880e9-49df-4661-a562-3a47b25fd0f1","date":"2025-12-12","images":[]},{"number":"101","chapter":"101","slug":"0387bc87-5063-4963-a9b9-c9164ee878e6","date":"2025-12-12","images":[]},{"number":"100","chapter":"100","slug":"dc1586aa-5146-4d8b-bf86-a10477852451","date":"2025-12-07","images":[]},{"number":"99","chapter":"99","slug":"147b0661-d003-4e23-b6c7-22f155e074e7","date":"2025-12-07","images":[]},{"number":"98","chapter":"98","slug":"5f9a52ba-ebb7-420b-89ad-6c8c7ea168a2","date":"2025-12-07","images":[]},{"number":"97","chapter":"97","slug":"5a8f7eb1-7b0f-4bfb-94f6-43918134d08f","date":"2025-11-29","images":[]},{"number":"96","chapter":"96","slug":"c94628d3-b62c-49ac-aa13-c33180c2af3c","date":"2025-11-29","images":[]},{"number":"95","chapter":"95","slug":"313bb0da-d604-4573-b33d-5d3ce8253bf6","date":"2025-11-12","images":[]},{"number":"94","chapter":"94","slug":"bb2f39d6-71b9-4abb-a60c-de1f69019ddc","date":"2025-11-12","images":[]},{"number":"93","chapter":"93","slug":"cf9033a0-9168-4a85-a18b-8c3f0860376b","date":"2025-11-12","images":[]},{"number":"92","chapter":"92","slug":"a08f03f5-f4db-4ee9-9945-e08ad0ef87e7","date":"2025-11-12","images":[]},{"number":"91","chapter":"91","slug":"cf671c52-0285-4c63-9f30-b736ecb712b5","date":"2025-11-01","images":[]},{"number":"90","chapter":"90","slug":"3a175b49-dc15-